	(629, "CVE-1999-1404", "1998-10-02T04:00:00.000", "2025-04-03T01:03:51.193", "IBM/Tivoli OPC Tracker Agent version 2 release 1 allows remote attackers to cause a denial of service (resource exhaustion) via malformed data to the localtracker client port (5011), which prevents the connection from being closed properly."),
