	(823, "CVE-1999-1430", "1999-01-01T05:00:00.000", "2025-04-03T01:03:51.193", "PIM software for Royal daVinci does not properly password-protext access to data stored in the .mdb (Microsoft Access) file, which allows local users to read the data without a password by directly accessing the files with a different application, such as Access."),
