	(1635, "CVE-2000-0046", "2000-01-10T05:00:00.000", "2025-04-03T01:03:51.193", "Buffer overflow in ICQ 99b 1.1.1.1 client allows remote attackers to execute commands via a malformed URL within an ICQ message."),
