	(1804, "CVE-2000-0227", "2000-03-23T05:00:00.000", "2025-04-03T01:03:51.193", "The Linux 2.2.x kernel does not restrict the number of Unix domain sockets as defined by the wmem_max parameter, which allows local users to cause a denial of service by requesting a large number of sockets."),
